The **Rust Foundation** is a non-profit [membership organization](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Membership_organization) incorporated in [United States](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States); it manages the Rust trademark, infrastructure, and assets.[206][49]

